Error [jet.InvalidGuardSplit]: `SharedGuard.split` needs two disjoint field projections
  --> tests/ui/shared_guard_split_overlap.jet:9:14
    |
  9 |     _: guard.split(fn(value) { value.left }, fn(value) { value.left })
    |              ^^^^^
 Why: Two editable guards may never point at the same field or at an enclosing and nested field
 Fix: Project sibling fields, such as `value.left` and `value.right`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0216
